# Wave W17-U (Route 204): bluff pine — a bluff pine in clean bright greens, tiered and full with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on bluff turf (ground baked in). Route 204’s own tree — split from Route 203’s coal pine beside it by the clean crown (bluff air vs mine smoke: same family, opposite weather) and from the Ruined Path’s register entire — this pine stands in the open over the road its continuation collapsed from.
